OL,3,ATroubles legacy bill is not an amnesty
OL,4,Afor soldiers - NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal is among a series of
OL,7,Fgovernment amendments being debated by
OL,8,FMPs on Monday after the long-awaited
OL,9,Flegislation returned to the House of
OL,10,FCommons.
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC News NI, Bryant said it
OL,13,Fwas a "sensible measure" to ensure
OL,14,Fthere was "more consistency" in how
OL,15,Fdecisions are made.
